      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Our team is sincerely apologizing for the cold breakfast items, the empty buffet, and the staff's lack of engagement. We are immediately reviewing kitchen protocols and training our front-of-house team to ensure this service is restored to the standard you expect. We would be grateful for you giving us one more chance to make this right directly by contacting our guest relations manager.",
